@baseUrl = http://localhost:6060
@username = admin
@password = admin123


### Login

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
  -- lua
  client.global.ACCESS_TOKEN = response.json.accessToken
%}


### Get notebook entries (paginated)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notebook?page=0&size=20&sort=desc HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}


### Get notebook entries with filters

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notebook?page=0&size=10&types=HIGHLIGHT,NOTE&bookId=&search=&sort=desc HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}


### Export notebook entries

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notebook/export?sort=desc HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}


### Get books with annotations

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notebook/books HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}


### Get books with search

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notebook/books?search= HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
